            "block_content": "3. Employees when required to perform a higher rated bargaining unit job as a temporary assignment of twenty (20) work days or more, shall be paid no less than the minimum rate for the higher rated job or an additional $5.00 per week, whichever is greater, if the following conditions have been met:",
